     <p>
   <p>
      We love running in the beautiful countryside around the Wyre Forest.
     <br>
      Everyone is welcome to come and join us, we love meeting new people. All we ask for is a contribution of &pound;1 per 
      person towards the cost of our insurance policy. <br>All runs start at 7:00pm on Thursday unless otherwise stated.
     <br>
<p>
